                "loc": "DEU.27.11+DEU.27.12+DEU.27.13+DEU.27.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nwo 27.11-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.8.33+JOS.8.34+JOS.8.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoc 8.33-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Rwot Lubaŋawu doŋ okelowu i lobo ma wubicito iye ka camone-ni, ci wubiketo gum obed i kom got Gerijim, ki ceno dano bibedo i kom got Eba!. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin godi-nu gitye loka Jordan, ma but piny yo tuŋ potoceŋ, tuŋ ka ma ceŋ poto iye-ni, i lobo pa jo Kanaan ma gibedo i Araba, ma okemo Gilgal, ma ka ŋet yadi kworo me More; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubiŋolo Jordan, wukato loka ca ka camo lobo ma Rwot Lubaŋawu bimiyowu. Ka doŋ wucamo, ma wubedo iye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci wugwokke wek wulub cik ki oŋon me cikke ducu ma doŋ aketo i nyimwu tin-ni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
